  "description": "RDForms, the form toolkit of the RDCore platform. The RDCore.Forms assembly is the form model, with no UI dependency: component classes, their properties and events, the instances of a form, the reader and writer of the RDForms document, and the readers that import a VB6 or MSForms form. The RDCore.Forms.Avalonia assembly holds the controls of a form, and the window built from the model, rendered with Avalonia.",
